{"id":98,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"人間力と学力を伸ばす中高一貫教育","feature_description":"千葉明徳中学校・高等学校は、学力の伸長と人間力の育成を大切にする中高一貫校です。日々の授業、探究、学校行事、部活動を通して、自ら考え行動する力と仲間と協力する姿勢を育てます。生徒一人ひとりの目標に寄り添い、将来に向けて主体的に学び続ける基礎を築きます。公式サイトの紹介内容をもとに、教育方針や学校生活を整理してまとめています。","clubs":[{"id":1057,"name":"サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://edu.chibameitoku.ac.jp/junior/school-life-j/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1058,"name":"女子サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://edu.chibameitoku.ac.jp/junior/school-life-j/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1059,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://edu.chibameitoku.ac.jp/junior/school-life-j/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1060,"name":"チアリーディング","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://edu.chibameitoku.ac.jp/junior/school-life-j/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1061,"name":"山岳","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://edu.chibameitoku.ac.jp/junior/school-life-j/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1062,"name":"硬式テニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://edu.chibameitoku.ac.jp/junior/school-life-j/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1063,"name":"陸上競技","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://edu.chibameitoku.ac.jp/junior/school-life-j/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1064,"name":"バドミントン","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://edu.chibameitoku.ac.jp/junior/school-life-j/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1065,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://edu.chibameitoku.ac.jp/junior/school-life-j/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1066,"name":"野球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://edu.chibameitoku.ac.jp/junior/school-life-j/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1067,"name":"ラグビー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://edu.chibameitoku.ac.jp/junior/school-life-j/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"}],"profile_sources":[{"id":484,"attribute_key":"religious_background","source_url":"https://www.nichinoken.co.jp/np5/